WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:01.335
What's the move?

00:00:03.462 --> 00:00:04.671
We lead our boys through it.

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:10.219
So, you'll write me?

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:14.515
A girl worth writing to
is hard to find.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.521
Not if you know where to look.

00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:22.189
I'm gonna miss you every second.

00:00:24.483 --> 00:00:25.317
Major Egan,

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.152
you were the first pilot
assigned to the 100th.

00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:28.403
Me and Buck Clevin.

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:33.075
You are in charge of 35 planes
and 350 air crewmen.

00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:36.662
Don't you die on me
before I get over there.

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:40.958
Something big is brewing.

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:44.253
The eighth will be sending up
the largest air armada

00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:46.547
ever assembled
in the history of mankind.

00:00:46.964 --> 00:00:49.091
Straight into Hitler's territory.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:54.179
We need complete
and total air superiority.

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:55.389
That's the mission.

00:00:58.267 --> 00:00:59.142
What?

00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:01.019
You might be the last
pretty face I ever see.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:12.197
I'm hit! I'm hit!

00:01:12.281 --> 00:01:13.323
Three's going down!

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:16.326
What's the move?

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:19.913
We lead our boys through it.

00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:24.835
All that we do…

00:01:26.587 --> 00:01:28.046
day in, day out,

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:30.465
does something to a guy,
doesn't it?

00:01:30.966 --> 00:01:32.509
We're here to fight the monsters.

00:01:33.343 --> 00:01:35.179
The things these people
are capable of…

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:37.014
They got it coming.

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:38.640
Trust me.

00:01:42.561 --> 00:01:44.688
Lord, guard and guide
the men who fly

00:01:45.147 --> 00:01:46.982
through the great spaces
of the sky.

00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:48.734
Are we Tuskegee men, or what?!

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:50.027
Sir, yes sir!

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.862
Be with them traversing the air,

00:01:52.696 --> 00:01:53.739
in darkening storms…

00:01:55.449 --> 00:01:56.575
or sunshine fair.

00:01:56.658 --> 00:01:57.868
I think we may be done!

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:59.244
We are gonna sit here
and take it!

00:02:00.204 --> 00:02:01.330
We're gonna
stick with our mission

00:02:01.413 --> 00:02:02.706
as long as we can fly.

00:02:04.917 --> 00:02:06.043
We won't go without a fight.

